---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Pricing — Free Antidetect Browser"
  description="AliasMode Standard is free and open source, with unlimited browser profiles, Cloud sync, and team collaboration."
>
  <section class="pricing-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Simple pricing</p>
    <h1>Everything you need. Free.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Manage unlimited accounts, synchronize your profiles, and work with your team without another browser subscription.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="plan-card">
    <div class="plan-main">
      <div class="plan-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">AliasMode Standard</p><h2>One plan. Full access.</h2></div><span class="free-pill">Free</span></div>
      <div class="price"><strong>$0</strong><span>for everyone</span></div>
      <p class="plan-copy">Start with the complete AliasMode experience. Create your free Cloud account inside the Windows app after installation.</p>
      <div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/download">Download &amp; sign up free</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="plan-features">
      <h3>Everything included</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><span>∞</span><div><strong>Unlimited browser profiles</strong><small>Create a profile for every account and project.</small></div></li>
        <li><span>◫</span><div><strong>Isolated browser identities</strong><small>Keep browser data and sessions separate.</small></div></li>
        <li><span>↻</span><div><strong>Encrypted profile sync</strong><small>Use portable profiles across supported devices.</small></div></li>
        <li><span>+</span><div><strong>Team collaboration</strong><small>Invite workspace members and share work.</small></div></li>
        <li><span>⌁</span><div><strong>Open-source desktop app</strong><small>Read the code and follow development.</small></div></li>
        <li><span>○</span><div><strong>Account-free Local mode</strong><small>Keep profiles on one computer when you prefer.</small></div></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pricing-note">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">Cloud or Local</p><h2>Choose how you work.</h2></div>
    <div><p>Sign in for synchronized profiles and team collaboration. Choose Local mode when you want browser profiles to stay on one computer without an AliasMode account.</p><a class="text-link" href="/local-vs-cloud">Compare Local and Cloud <span>→</span></a></div>
  </section>

  <section class="pricing-cta">
    <p class="eyebrow">AliasMode Standard · $0</p>
    <h2>Start managing multiple accounts for free.</h2>
    <a class="button" href="/download">Download for Windows</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .pricing-hero { margin: 2rem auto 4rem; text-align: center; }
  .pricing-hero h1 { font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5.8rem); margin-inline: auto; max-width: 12ch; }
  .pricing-hero .lead { margin-inline: auto; max-width: 52ch; }
  .plan-card { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #dbe3ee; box-shadow: 0 2rem 5rem rgba(28, 52, 88, .12); display: grid; grid-template-columns: .9fr 1.1fr; margin: 0 auto 6rem; max-width: 62rem; overflow: hidden; }
  .plan-main { background: #111827; color: white; display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem); }
  .plan-heading { align-items: flex-start; display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: space-between; }
  .plan-heading .eyebrow { color: #8da7ff; margin-top: 0; }
  .plan-heading h2 { font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3vw, 2.5rem); max-width: 12ch; }
  .free-pill { background: #31b8c7; border-radius: 2rem; color: #062f36; font-size: .7rem; font-weight: 800; padding: .35rem .7rem; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .price { align-items: baseline; display: flex; gap: .7rem; margin: 3rem 0 1.2rem; }
  .price strong { font-size: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 6.5rem); letter-spacing: -.08em; line-height: .8; }
  .price span { color: #aebbd0; font-size: .85rem; }
  .plan-copy { color: #aebbd0; font-size: .9rem; }
  .plan-main .actions { margin-top: auto; padding-top: 1rem; }
  .plan-main .button { background: white; color: #173c9d; text-align: center; width: 100%; }
  .plan-features { padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem); }
  .plan-features h3 { font-size: 1.15rem; margin: 0 0 1.5rem; }
  .plan-features ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; max-width: none; padding: 0; }
  .plan-features li { align-items: flex-start; border-top: 1px solid #e1e8f1; display: grid; gap: .9rem; grid-template-columns: 2rem 1fr; padding: .9rem 0; }
  .plan-features li:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid #e1e8f1; }
  .plan-features li > span { align-items: center; background: #eaf0ff; border-radius: .35rem; color: #2457d6; display: flex; font: 800 .8rem/1 ui-monospace, monospace; height: 2rem; justify-content: center; width: 2rem; }
  .plan-features li div { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .plan-features strong { font-size: .88rem; }
  .plan-features small { color: #64748b; font-size: .72rem; }
  .pricing-note { align-items: start; background: #eaf0ff; display: grid; gap: 3rem; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; margin-bottom: 6rem; padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem); }
  .pricing-note h2 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); }
  .text-link { color: #2457d6; font-weight: 750; text-decoration: none; }
  .text-link span { display: inline-block; transition: transform .18s ease; }
  .text-link:hover span { transform: translateX(.2rem); }
  .pricing-cta { margin: 0 auto; max-width: 50rem; text-align: center; }
  .pricing-cta h2 { font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 4rem); margin-inline: auto; max-width: 16ch; }
  .pricing-cta .button { margin-top: 1rem; }
  @media (max-width: 46rem) {
    .pricing-hero { margin-top: 0; }.plan-card, .pricing-note { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }.plan-main { min-height: 30rem; }.pricing-note { gap: 1rem; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .text-link span { transition: none; } }
</style>
